# Dyad Context Management (v0.8+)
# Excludes token-heavy volumes (300k+ words), samples, Knowledgebase.md
# Keeps essentials: README.md, _config.yml, assets/, volumes/README.md/summaries.md auto-included via non-match

# Heavy volumes (main token sink)
volumes/**

# Samples
samples/**

# Massive manual
Knowledgebase.md

# Optional: Keep light summaries if needed (uncomment)
# !volumes/summaries.md
# !volumes/README.md
